# Local changes to the upstream source in src/ (or mpc/), as unified diffs against the files as they
# were vendored (charlesvestal/schwung-hera 255be06, module v0.1.7). Each is described in README.md under
# "Changes for the MPC".
--- a/src/dsp/hera_plugin.cpp
